 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Cells are 1 (black), 0 (white), 9 (empty) or -1 (boundary). Fill every empty cell with 0 or 1 so that every pair of 4-adjacent non-boundary cells has different colours; boundary cells stay -1. In a connected region (4-adjacency through non-boundary cells) with no pre-coloured cell, the first cell in row-major order is black. Return the filled grid, or [] when the pre-coloured cells make that impossible.",
